  "summary": "A: the host scheduler harness build is fixed by adding the missing NSEC_PER_SEC host constant in tests/idma_scheduler_harness.c and injecting legacy research_begin/quiet/capture stand-ins in tests/test_idma_scheduler.py. The real idma_run_session2() and idma_run_session() wrappers remain extracted; injected legacy hooks refuse non-NULL legacy research requests, so all existing cfg==NULL legacy tests keep their current behavior. Production driver/RTL are untouched. B: docs/mac-research2.md is corrected for grouped cwd shell semantics, local-only preflight versus postboot board CLI SHA256/--caps2 checks, and the intended offline analyzer CLI entry. A full draft handoff docs/research-two-bit-mac-20261003.md is added for one common fw_payload.bin/new 6.5.0-rc2-00093-gc0f5e13ea81f first SD update by the user's established method, two BITs with automated JTAG switching, E2 64 then method 462 frozen plans, no rerun, short gate/errorstop/allraw preservation, and no board claims. Build status is explicitly pending; no execution or board result is claimed.",
